**LEVEL 3: Explicit Task Control (8x + tuning)**
```chapel
config const numTasks = here.maxTaskPar;  // Auto-detect CPU cores

coforall tid in 0..#numTasks {            // Create explicit tasks
  const myStart = (tid * n) / numTasks;
  const myEnd = ((tid+1) * n) / numTasks;

