### 4.1 BlockDist - Contiguous Block Distribution

**Use Case**: Distribute large arrays across multiple nodes

```chapel
use BlockDist;

config const n = 10000;
const Space = {0..#n, 0..#n};

// Create block distribution
const BlkDist = new blockDist(boundingBox=Space);
const BlockSpace = BlkDist.createDomain(Space);
var BlockArray: [BlockSpace] real;

// Computation automatically distributed
forall (i,j) in BlockSpace do
  BlockArray[i,j] = heavy_computation(i, j);

// Performance: Owner-computes model
// - Locale 0 computes its block in parallel
// - Locale 1 computes its block in parallel
// - NO internode communication for forall
```

**Scaling**: N locales = N*8x speedup (8x per locale + N-way distribution)

### 4.2 CyclicDist - Round-Robin Distribution

