// Round-robin assignment prevents load imbalance
// Example: 4 locales, 8x8 array
// Locale 0: (0,0), (0,4), (1,1), (1,5), ...
// Locale 1: (0,1), (0,5), (1,2), (1,6), ...
// Locale 2: (0,2), (0,6), (1,3), (1,7), ...
