### 4.3 Multi-locale Training Loop

```chapel
use BlockDist;

config const numBatches = 10000;
config const batchSize = 32;

// Distribute batch processing across locales
const batchDist = new blockDist({0..#numBatches});
const batchDomain: domain(1) dmapped batchDist = {0..#numBatches};

var losses: [batchDomain] real;

// Data parallelism: Each locale processes its batches
forall batch in batchDomain do {
  // Load batch (colocated with computation)
  var (X, Y) = loadBatch(batch);

  // Forward pass (uses local data)
  var logits = neuralNet.forward(X);

  // Compute loss (local reduction)
  var batchLoss = crossEntropy(logits, Y);
  losses[batch] = batchLoss;
}

// Global reduction (automatic inter-locale communication)
var totalLoss = + reduce losses;
var avgLoss = totalLoss / numBatches;

writeln("Average loss: ", avgLoss);
```

### 4.4 Alignment & Locality

```chapel
// Aligned domains ensure NO communication for common indices

